    {
      "block_id": "page-0897-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "Tachycardia, seizures, QRS prolongation, \nQT prolongation, arrhythmia. Agitation \nand toxic psychosis also reported. Fatal \nserotonin syndrome may occur if taken \nwith venlafaxine.8\n",
