      "block_id": "page-0897-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Mianserin18–20\nLow\nUnclear but probably more than \n1000mg.\nFatality unlikely if mianserin \ntaken alone.\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.889801025390625,
        259.44219970703125,
