      "block_id": "page-0897-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "Mirtazapine3,21–24\nLow\nFatality unlikely in overdose of \nmirtazapine alone. One death \nreported following overdose \nwith 990mg.25\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.887298583984375,
        304.4596862792969,
        283.0848083496094,
        343.169677734375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c3e1b036fdfdd38e130b70dc9dd5fe8ad6372c1c8586030f7a5b36802b031a18"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0897-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Sedation; even large overdose may be \nasymptomatic. Tachycardia/hypertension \nsometimes seen. Agitation.\n",
      "bbox": [
        293.8898010253906,
        304.4696960449219,
        424.5848388671875,
        333.17218017578125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "953dfaad1dfddbe50b5c05475b2d8814dbe52257fb6e89f714e3e0236a564991"
