    {
      "block_id": "page-0897-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Trazodone10,36–39\nLow\nUnclear but probably more than \n10g.\nFatality unlikely in overdose of \ntrazodone alone. Mortality rate \nabout 1 in 10,000 exposures.24\n",
